  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "nadia.conard@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker (NYSE:SYK) announced today an adjustment to its commercial organizational structure. Spencer S. Stiles will serve as Group President of Orthopaedics and Spine and will oversee Stryker’s Joint Replacement, Trauma &amp; Extremities and Spine divisions. J. Andrew Pierce, Group President of MedSurg and Neurotechnology will oversee Stryker’s Instruments, Medical, Endoscopy, Sustainability and Neurotechnology businesses.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2019/Stryker-announces-commercial-structure-realignment/default.aspx\">See full release here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 13 2019 17:54:27 GMT+0000",
